--##########| PSMCA v2.4 |#########--
Poetic Signature Measurements Compass
Analyst takes your input text and 
computes the 9 PSMC metrics:
#####################################
<n,P,L,W,S,P:L,W:P,W:L,S:W>
#####################################
As well as visualizing PSMC for you
as per PSM Theory by Fut. Prof. JWL
REF: doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.21983975
#####################################

#0.0--[we'll need versioning]
V:vVER:{v2.4}

#0:---[store text]
V:vIN
#1:---[compute: n]
Y!:vIN|V:vN #lexical cardinality

####| 4 CARDINAL METRICS |####

#2:---[compute: P]
Y:vIN|V:|Y!:|F:^0$:lPSet
Y:vIN|r:|r!:|g.:@|r!:\.+:.|r!:@@+:=
d:@|r!:[^=]:,|r!:,+:,|d:=|v:|y!:
L:lPSet
V:vP # total paragraphs

#3:---[compute: L]
Y:vIN|V:|Y!:|F:^0$:lLSet
Y:vIN|g.:@|r!:[^@]+:,|r!:,@:,|v:|y!:
L:lLSet
V:vL # total lines

#4:---[compute: W]
Y:vIN|V:|Y!:|F:^0$:lWSet
Y:vIN|g!:,|r!:\w+:@|d!:@|v:|y!:
L:lWSet
V:vW # total words

#5:---[compute: S]
Y:vIN|V:|Y!:|F:^0$:lSSet
Y:vIN|d!:[\S]|v:|y!:
L:lSSet
V:vS # total [visible] symbols

####| 4 AUXILIARY METRICS |####
#6:---[compute: P:L]
R@:{#vP#/#vL#}|R.:
V:vPD # paragraph density
#7:---[compute: W:P]
R@:{#vW#/#vP#}|R.:
V:vPWD # paragraph-word density
#8:---[compute: W:L]
R@:{#vW#/#vL#}|R.:
V:vLWD # line-word density
#9:---[compute: S:W]
R@:{#vS#/#vW#}|R.:
V:vWSD # word-symbol density

####| 9 PSMC METRICS |####
R@:{PSMC: <#vN#,#vP#,#vL#,#vW#,#vS#,#vPD#,#vPWD#,#vLWD#,#vWSD#>

Poetic Signature Measurements Compass
detailed PSMC ANALYST (#vVER#) REPORT follows...

----|BREAKDOWN|----
LC[lexical cardinality]: #vN#
==CARDINAL METRICS==
P[paragraphs]: #vP#
L[lines]: #vL#
W[words]: #vW#
S[symbols]: #vS#
==AUXILIARY METRICS==
PD[paragraph density]: #vPD#
PWD[paragraph-word density]: #vPWD#
LWD[line-word density]: #vLWD#
WSD[word-symbol density]: #vWSD#

----|VISUALIZATION|----

                  [#vP#]
                   |
            [#vLWD#]    |     [#vPD#]
              \    |    /
               \   |   /
                \  |  /
                 \ | /
   [#vW#]------------[#vN#]------------[#vS#]
                 / | \
                /  |  \
               /   |   \
              /    |    \
            [#vPWD#]    |     [#vWSD#]
                   |
                  [#vL#]

----|FOR TEXT|----
#vIN#
}